   "hs_email_body": {
    "body": {
     "html": "<p>Hi&nbsp;{{ contact.firstname }},</p>\n<p>We couldn't help but notice you haven't completed your account <a href=\"https://www.fsc-live.com/dvapp/registration.php\" rel=\" noopener\">registration on <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span>Labs.com<span style=\"text-decoration: none;\">!</span></a></p>\n<p>I'm reaching out to remind you of benefits you get after joining our community of medical professionals who <strong>stand for more. </strong>You can expect:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Wholesale pricing</li>\n<li>Free shipping</li>\n<li>Opportunities to share your expertise on the <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span> blog</li>\n<li>Private labeling services to strengthen your brand</li>\n<li>A dedicated sales rep who is ready to help you grow your practice!</li>\n</ul>\n<p>We want all customers to have a great experience with us, so we take a somewhat unique approach to on-boarding after you sign up.</p>\n<p>Instead of going back and forth about agreements and forms, we will email you one document that gathers key information. This helps us streamline your account setup and gives us insights into how we can best help you.</p>\n<p>Want to try it out for yourself?</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">{{cta('17c66250-fd70-4276-8f2d-dbf916fbf2c6')}}</p>\n<p>We hope to work with you soon!</p>\n<p><em>-Brandi&nbsp;</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
    },
